      en: ["First mentioned in historical records in 1628", "Home to the Moldova Steel Works (MMZ)", "Located on the left bank of the Dniester", "Central hub for cement production in the region", "St. Michael's Cathedral is one of the largest in Transnistria", "Population of approximately 45,000 residents"],
