      en: ["Ceadîr-Lunga was officially granted city status in 1958.", "It is home to 'At-Prolin', the only professional horse breeding farm in the country.", "The city hosts the Gagauz National Theater, established in 1997.", "It is located approximately 125 kilometers south of the capital city, Chișinău.", "The city is a major junction for the railway connecting Moldova to Ukraine.", "The annual 'Altın At' horse racing festival is a major cultural attraction here."],
