      en: ["Briceni was first documented in 1562 during the reign of Despot Vodă.", "The city is the heart of Moldova's apple-growing region, with high export capacity.", "It is located approximately 230 kilometers from the capital, Chișinău.", "The city lies near the 'Emil Racoviță' cave, one of the world's longest gypsum caves.", "Briceni serves as a key transit point for the M14 highway connecting to Ukraine.", "The town features several monuments dedicated to the local soldiers of WWII."],
