      en: ["Rezina was first mentioned in a document issued by Stephen the Great on February 5, 1495.", "The city’s cement plant is one of the largest industrial complexes in the entire republic.", "Rezina is situated roughly 98 kilometers to the north and east of Chisinau.", "The town’s elevation varies significantly due to its location on the steep Dniester riverbanks.", "Nearby Țipova Monastery contains 18 rooms carved into the cliffs, dating back to the 11th century.", "The town serves as a major administrative and judicial hub for the surrounding rural area."],
