      en: ["Cantemir was officially granted city status on April 6, 1973.", "The city was named after the 18th-century Moldovan philosopher and ruler Dimitrie Cantemir.", "Cantemir is located roughly 126 kilometers south of Chisinau.", "The town is situated at an average elevation of 53 meters above sea level.", "The local canning factory was historically one of the largest in the Soviet Union.", "The city is a key center for the southern Moldovan wine industry."],
