      en: ["The first historical mention of Camenca occurred in 1608.", "Prince Peter Wittgenstein built a grand palace here in 1819.", "Camenca was the first place in the region to offer organized grape therapy.", "The town's current population is approximately 8,000 residents.", "The Nistru Sanatorium was majorly expanded during the Soviet era.", "The area around Camenca is renowned for its high-quality terrace vineyards."],
