      en: ["First mentioned in historical documents in the year 1437.", "The railway station is situated at an elevation of approximately 232 meters.", "Located on the primary railway line between Chișinău and the Romanian border.", "Situated within the ecologically valuable Codru hill zone.", "The municipality consists of both an urban and a rural settlement area.", "A key local site for grain storage and food processing industries."],
